      "name": "Short-Term Price Reversion V2",
      "class_name": "",
      "description": "This signal computes the z-score of the price deviation from a 50-bar moving average, adjusted for the recent volatility over the same window. A high positive z-score indicates overbought conditions, while a high negative z-score suggests oversold conditions.",
